msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-can-pmu.rst:13
#: 576de1ef9d204f3a9e317396e41e923b
msgid "CUAV's CAN/DroneCAN PMU is a drone power management module with built-in STM32F4 processor running CUAV's ITT compensation algorithm to accurately measure the voltage and current of the drone's battery. It supports 6~62V voltage input, and the POWER output port can output 5V/ 8A. It uses advanced CAN bus communication and supports the standard `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org/>`__ protocol. Each PMU is factory calibrated to ensure good consistency and high accuracy."
msgstr ""

